Z||000007||Jay||05-29-2001||06:19 PM||||Yeah, I jsut killed myself a whale!  I'm using it to feed my family and my pack of huskies.  Time to start building up that layer of blubber to survive the winter! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  Welcome to the forum.  I wouldn't put a kit on a convertable.  I've always wanted to do that to my GT.  You know if you join the club you get a discount on performance work done at Race-Tech.  I would love to see the car.  I've seen two in Toronto before, one is an 87se (silver), I know the owner. Is yours black?<P>------------------<BR>Jay<BR>1986 Northstar GT<BR>www.members.home.net/jaygrande<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/gangster.gif"> ||||reg||1
